WEBVTT

00:32:33.663 --> 00:32:37.829
So talk about what can go wrong with that,

00:32:37.829 --> 00:32:42.329
so let's move away from just the sort
of economic displacement factor.

00:32:42.996 --> 00:32:50.288
You were a co-founder of Open Eye because
you saw existential risks to

00:32:50.288 --> 00:32:54.704
humanity from high today. What
would you put as the sort of

00:32:54.746 --> 00:33:01.746
the most worrying of those risks? And
how is open eye working to minimize?